wp-image-6154\" alt=\"Happy Holidays\" srcset=\"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-content\/uploads\/Templates-Redes-Sociais-MAEIL-1024x1024.png 1024w, https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-content\/uploads\/Templates-Redes-Sociais-MAEIL-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-content\/uploads\/Templates-Redes-Sociais-MAEIL-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-content\/uploads\/Templates-Redes-Sociais-MAEIL-768x768.png 768w, https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-content\/uploads\/Templates-Redes-Sociais-MAEIL.png 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-2c0c22a elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"2c0c22a\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-720d6b0\" data-id=\"720d6b0\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f611d55 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f611d55\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We&#8217;ve completed another year, and in January we celebrate 24 years in our journey towards the digitalization of the supply chain and SMEs. In 1999, we started in Shipping (Maritime Transport) and today we work with the entire logistics chain. Due to all the circumstances that we already know, we will have a challenging year, with inflation, interest rates, and with the deplorable war in Ukraine.<\/p><p>We have another very relevant challenge in the next 3 years of our activity, with the NEXUS project co-led with the Port of Sines, in the only mobilizing agenda approved by the Government for this industry to promote digitalization and innovation in the sector, in the first cluster created in Portugal for this industry, transport and logistics.<\/p><p>We are responsible and leaders in the\u00a0<a style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https:\/\/mkt.maeil.pt\/got\/d-7a2b61e6igpe1fr?_ga=2.133524238.1424658498.1671700213-1217148445.1671181206\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Smart Logistics<\/a>\u00a0area.<\/p><p>We have participated as members and juries in the <a href=\"https:\/\/aspban.eu\/en\/home\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ASPBAN<\/a> project, a blue innovation ecosystem in Europe that brings together more than 25 Atlantic ports and 40 selected startups, and we have collaborated with FIATA and APAT for the adoption of the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.efbl.fiata.org\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">eFBL<\/a> in the freight forwarding community at a global level.<\/p><p>We have also supported and invested in vertical startups in the sector,\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/mkt.maeil.pt\/got\/769ba866e6igperH?_ga=2.201703697.1424658498.1671700213-1217148445.1671181206\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cargofive<\/a>\u00a0and\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/mkt.maeil.pt\/got\/1dd0b80ce6igpe1gc?_ga=2.201703697.1424658498.1671700213-1217148445.1671181206\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Meight<\/a>, which are with us in this vision and strategy, and we have participated in a VC technology investment fund in Portugal,\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/mkt.maeil.pt\/got\/5b4734b9e6igpe1gd?_ga=2.201703697.1424658498.1671700213-1217148445.1671181206\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Shilling<\/a>.<\/p><p>We are building new products to dematerialize documents and develop new management tools in the cloud (<a href=\"https:\/\/mkt.maeil.pt\/got\/bcd23bae6igpe1d?_ga=2.171322400.1424658498.1671700213-1217148445.1671181206\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">webtrans<\/a>,\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/mkt.maeil.pt\/got\/ba4748f7e6igpe1fs?_ga=2.171322400.1424658498.1671700213-1217148445.1671181206\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SHoT<\/a>,\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/mkt.maeil.pt\/got\/7-d250-4e6igpe1ft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">shipperform<\/a>) for our customers and other new SMB&#8217;s who want to join in this journey of digital transition, in this period of acceleration and innovation on a global scale .\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-e558644 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"e558644\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-67d8d6e\" data-id=\"67d8d6e\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c774d86 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"c774d86\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"418\" src=\"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-content\/uploads\/webtrans.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-6146\" alt=\"Boas Festas\" srcset=\"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-content\/uploads\/webtrans.jpg 800w, https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-content\/uploads\/webtrans-300x157.jpg 300w, https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-content\/uploads\/webtrans-768x401.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-b0c0a75 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"b0c0a75\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-8a26d5f\" data-id=\"8a26d5f\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-21dcfed elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"21dcfed\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We will increase our software development team in Aveiro and new management, sales and support collaborators will be part of our team in Cascais, with the aim of improving, growing and innovating for our customers and for this sector and SMEs in general.<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>We count on you! Count on us.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-181692d elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-de